---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import MethodEntry from '../../components/MethodEntry.astro';
import { entries, LIMIT_SENTENCE } from '../../lib/zakat';
import content from '../../data/content.json';
import '../../styles/zakat.css';
const method = content.method;
---
<Shell title="Zakat method and sources" active="method">
  <article class="prose method">
    <header>
      <span class="eyebrow">Method first</span>
      <h1>Zakat method and sources</h1>
      <p>Every figure and position in the calculator comes from the entries below. Quran text is copied exactly (Arabic and the Pickthall translation). Hadith are paraphrased: the collection, number and grading are shown as sunnah.com shows them, with a link to the page. Where scholars differ, each position names who states it and links to the page that states it.</p>
      <p class="notice warning">This is an educational summary, not a fatwa. Each citation was checked against the page it cites, but no scholar has reviewed this page. {LIMIT_SENTENCE}</p>
      <ul class="method-toc" aria-label="Entries on this page">
        {entries.map(e => <><li><a href={`#${e.id}`}>{e.title}</a></li>{' '}</>)}
        <li><a href="#not-accessible">What we could not open</a></li>
      </ul>
    </header>{' '}
    {entries.map(entry => <><MethodEntry entry={entry} />{' '}</>)}
    <section class="not-accessible" id="not-accessible" aria-labelledby="na-title">
      <h2 id="na-title">What we could not open, and so did not use</h2>
      <p>These sources were looked for but could not be read in full, so no position from them appears anywhere in the calculator.</p>
      <ul>{method.notAccessible.map(item => <li><strong>{item.item}.</strong> {item.reason}</li>)}</ul>
    </section>{' '}
    <p class="actions top-gap"><a class="button" href="/">Return to the calculator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a class="button secondary" href="/zakat-al-fitr/">Zakat al-fitr</a></p>
  </article>
</Shell>
